    "description": {
      "content": "The Cloud SQL Admin API provides programmatic access to manage Cloud SQL instances, databases, users, and related resources. It supports MySQL, PostgreSQL, and SQL Server database engines, enabling automated provisioning, configuration, backup management, and monitoring of managed relational database instances.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Google Cloud",
